    nhan_xet:      { value: "⭐⭐ BUOC NGOAT CHINH SACH 18/10 — CV 9608/NHNN-CSTT: lan dau NHNN dung CHE TAI ROOM TIN DUNG de buoc giam LS huy dong (toi thieu 0,5dpt, ky han >=6T). Truoc do suot 5 thang chi co cac cong cu NOI THANH KHOAN (TT08, TT25-SFL, QD1743-KBNN, CV4551, CV8509, TT50) va deu KHONG keo duoc TT1 xuong", updated: "18/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] CV 9608/NHNN-CSTT 18/10 + so tien gui NHNN T8", note: "⭐ VI SAO LAN NAY KHAC: cac lan truoc la NOI phia cung thanh khoan, truyen dan qua thi truong — va panel III-b chung minh truyen dan DA TAT (he so 3T = 0,21, 6T am). Lan nay la MENH LENH HANH CHINH co che tai, di VONG QUA co che truyen dan · ⭐ DU BAO CO CHE (lap lai kich ban tran 4,75%): TANG 1 (niem yet) SE GIAM THAT vi co che tai; TANG 3 (thoa thuan, tu 9,0%) va goi uu dai (8,9-9,55%) KHONG bi rang buoc → khoang cach noi rong tu 2,5dpt len 3,0-3,5dpt · ⚠️ RUI RO DO LUONG: khi tang 1 giam ma tang 3 khong giam, cac chi bao dua tren NIEM YET se cho tin hieu SAI ve chi phi von thuc. Tu nay phai doc tang 3 va goi uu dai moi biet COF bien that · ⭐ NEN TANG HO TRO: tien gui dan cu cuoi T8 dat ky luc 11,43tr ty (+10,63% so dau nam), nhanh hon tin dung — C/D Macro that la 116,8% chu khong phai 125,2%. Day la can cu de NHNN tu tin ban CV 9608" },
    nm_1_3t:       { value: "1,6–4,75", updated: "18/10/2026", source: "[MARKET] Vietstock tong hop bieu niem yet den 8/10/2026", note: "NIEM YET 1-3 THANG (den 8/10): dai 1,6-4,75%/nam · Can tren CHINH LA TRAN NHNN 4,75% cho ky han <6T · Rieng ky han 3 THANG: it nhat 10 NH da kich tran 4,75% (VCB Neo, Sacombank, MBV, OCB, BVBank, PVcomBank, VietABank, Saigonbank, PGBank, Bac A Bank) · ⭐ DOI CHIEU TT2: 1 Thang lien ngan hang 5,00% (BQ tuan NHNN 05-09/10) — CAO HON tran TT1 0,25dpt. Tien gui dan cu ky han nay dang RE HON vay lien ngan hang → NH khong co dong luc ha tiep · ⚠️ KHONG nam trong pham vi CV 9608 (chi ap ky han >=6T)" },
    nm_3_6t:       { value: "4,75 (kich tran)", updated: "18/10/2026", source: "[MARKET] Vietstock tong hop bieu niem yet den 8/10/2026", note: "NIEM YET 3 THANG DEN DUOI 6 THANG: KICH TRAN 4,75%/nam o phan lon NH lon · ⭐⭐ NGHICH LY TRAN — day la nut that cot loi: TT2 ky han 3 THANG = 6,58% (BQ tuan NHNN 05-09/10), CAO HON tran TT1 1,83dpt. NH can von 3 thang thi vay lien ngan hang DAT HON huy dong dan cu, nhung khong duoc huy dong qua 4,75% vi vuong tran · HE QUA: cau von bi DAY DON sang ky han >=6T de thoat tran — chinh co che nay bom ap luc vao nhom >6T · He so truyen dan tai moc 3 thang chi 0,21 (xem panel III-b) · ⚠️ KHONG nam trong pham vi CV 9608" },
    cv9608:        { value: "⭐⭐ CV 9608/NHNN-CSTT (18/10/2026, Thong doc Pham Duc An ky) — DA DOC TOAN VAN 5 TRANG · MUC 1.2 nguyen van: 'Truoc mat, dieu chinh giam lai suat tien gui niem yet toi thieu 0,5%/nam doi voi cac ky han tu 6 thang tro len, tuyet doi khong dua tang lai suat huy dong, canh tranh khong lanh manh, gay bat on den an ninh tai chinh - tien te; giam lai suat cho vay khach hang, trong do tap trung giam tu 1,5-2%/nam doi voi linh vuc san xuat, kinh doanh va linh vuc uu tien'", updated: "19/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] CV 9608/NHNN-CSTT 18/10/2026 — TOAN VAN 5 trang, ky Thong doc Pham Duc An", note: "⚠️⚠️ SUA HIEU SAI NGAY 18/10 — PHAM VI MUC 1.6 HEP HON NHIEU: nguyen van ap dung cho 'Hoat dong mua han mien truy doi bo chung tu theo thu tin dung DO CHINH TCTD PHAT HANH'. Ban ghi truoc coi la ap chung moi L/C — SAI · ⭐⭐ PHAT HIEN QUAN TRONG: TT50 va CV 9608 BU KHUYET CHO NHAU, pham vi KHONG GIAO NHAU. TT50 diem g khoan 3 Dieu 9 tinh vao TONG MUC DU NO nhung TRU L/C tu phat hanh. CV 9608 muc 1.6 lai nham DUNG phan TT50 loai tru: L/C tu phat hanh bi TRU vao ROOM TIN DUNG 2026 ('TCTD kiem soat tang truong tin dung khong vuot qua muc du no tin dung toi da nam 2026 da duoc NHNN thong bao TRU DI so du cua cac khoan mua han mien truy doi bo chung tu phat sinh trong nam 2026') · ⇒ BANG PHAN DINH: L/C do NH KHAC phat hanh → TT50 diem g → tong muc du no → gioi han Dieu 136 (FI limit tren NH phat hanh/xac nhan) || L/C TU PHAT HANH → TT50 KHONG tinh (da tinh o diem b cam ket ngoai bang) nhung CV 9608 TRU ROOM. CA HAI NUA DEU DA BI BIT · ⭐ MUC 2.3 — KHUNG PHAP LY CON SE DOI TIEP: Vu Tin dung duoc giao 'nghien cuu, de xuat Thong doc NHNN sua doi, bo sung quy dinh ve cho vay doi voi cac nhu cau von tai khoan 8, khoan 9 va khoan 10 Dieu 8 Thong tu so 39/2016/TT-NHNN' VA 'quy dinh lien quan den nghiep vu mua han mien truy doi bo chung tu theo thu tin dung do chinh TCTD phat hanh, bao dam kiem soat duoc rui ro va co can cu de xu ly vi pham' → se co van ban sua TT39 va quy dinh rieng cho nghiep vu nay · ⭐ MUC 3 CHE TAI (xac nhan dung): 'Tu nay den cuoi nam 2026', TCTD khong tuan thu chi dao ve lai suat hoac canh tranh khong lanh manh → (i) 'Xem xet lai chi tieu tang truong tin dung trong thoi gian con lai cua nam 2026 va giao chi tieu tang truong tin dung thap nam 2027' (ii) 'Yeu cau thuc hien mot hoac mot so ty le bao dam an toan cao hon muc quy dinh' · ⭐ MUC 1.5 — DAU HIEU NHAN DIEN NHOM KHACH HANG LIEN QUAN: cung nguoi quan ly hoac dai dien theo phap luat hoac nguoi so huu tren 5% von dieu le; chung TSBD; chung mot chu so huu TSBD; tap trung von vao cung mot du an; co chung nguon tra no · ⭐ MUC 1.11: ban hanh tieu chi 'phap nhan, ca nhan khac co moi quan he tiem an rui ro' theo diem g khoan 24 Dieu 4 Luat Cac TCTD" },
    lc_noidia:     { value: "⭐⭐ LO HONG GOC NAM O TT 21/2024 (hieu luc 1/7/2024): Dieu 3 khoan 1 — nghiep vu thu tin dung la CAP TIN DUNG qua 4 nghiep vu: PHAT HANH, XAC NHAN, THUONG LUONG THANH TOAN, HOAN TRA · Dieu 3 khoan 2 + khoan 8 — MUA HAN MIEN TRUY DOI xep la 'HOAT DONG KINH DOANH KHAC lien quan den thu tin dung', KHONG nam trong 4 nghiep vu cap tin dung", updated: "19/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] TT 21/2024/TT-NHNN Dieu 3 khoan 1-2-8-12, Dieu 16", note: "⭐⭐ CO CHE LO HONG — CUNG MOT DONG TIEN, HAI KET QUA PHAP LY: (1) THUONG LUONG THANH TOAN (mua co ky han / mua co bao luu quyen truy doi) = CAP TIN DUNG cho BEN THU HUONG → vao tong muc du no, an room (2) MUA HAN MIEN TRUY DOI = KHONG phai cap tin dung → truoc day khong vao tong muc du no, khong an room. Ca hai deu la NH tra tien som cho ben ban; chi khac GIU hay BO quyen truy doi · ⭐ CHUOI L/C NOI DIA TU PHAT HANH: (a) NH phat hanh L/C noi dia cho ben mua X → cap tin dung cho X, ghi cam ket ngoai bang, TRU KY QUY theo TT22 (b) ben ban Y xuat trinh bo chung tu (c) NH mua han mien truy doi tu Y → Y nhan tien ngay, het nghia vu; truoc day KHONG tinh vao limit cua ai (d) X tra tien khi L/C dao han 90-360 ngay · BAN CHAT KINH TE la khoan vay cho X, nhung ghi nhan phap ly thi khong phai · ⭐ TU NAY DOI 3 THU: [NGAY] CV 9608 muc 1.6 → tru ROOM tin dung 2026 || [01/12/2026] TT50 diem b bo menh de tru ky quy → cam ket phat hanh L/C tinh DU vao tong muc du no cua X || [01/12/2026] TT50 diem g → neu L/C do NH KHAC phat hanh thi vao tong muc du no voi NH phat hanh do (FI limit NOI DIA — diem hoan toan moi) · ⭐ DU BAO BUOC TIEP THEO: CV 9608 muc 2.3 giao Vu Tin dung de xuat 'quy dinh lien quan den nghiep vu mua han mien truy doi bo chung tu theo thu tin dung do chinh TCTD phat hanh, bao dam kiem soat duoc rui ro va CO CAN CU DE XU LY VI PHAM'. Cach sua trien de nhat la chuyen mua han mien truy doi tu khoan 2 (hoat dong kinh doanh khac) sang khoan 1 (nghiep vu cap tin dung) cua TT21 — khi do cau truc nay cham dut hoan toan · ⚠️ TT21 Dieu 16 DA yeu cau phan loai tai san co va trich lap du phong cho hoat dong nay, tuc rui ro da duoc thua nhan, chi thieu rang buoc ve GIOI HAN" },
