    chi_2t:     { value: "GIAI NGAN DTC 7T (Bo Tai chinh, den 31/7): 425.312 ty = 41,9% KH · 8T (Nghi quyet 262/NQ-CP 5/9): 514,6 nghin ty = 45,9% KH, +35,4% YoY · Rieng T8 giai ngan 95,7 nghin ty — cao thu hai tu dau nam", updated: "14/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] Bo Tai chinh + Nghi quyet 262/NQ-CP 5/9", note: "⚠️ CHUA TIM DUOC so 9T · Toc do 8T (45,9%) cao hon trung binh 2018-2025 cung ky (38,7%) · Chinh phu don doc 25 bo nganh va 16 dia phuong co ty le thap hon trung binh · Siet quy dinh tam ung von, kien quyet dieu chuyen von tu du an cham sang du an tot · ⭐ HAM Y: con ~54% KH (hon 600k ty) phai giai ngan trong Q4 → cong voi ~630k ty room tin dung con lai, Q4 la quy bom tien lon nhat nam" },
    dong_kbnn:  { value: "DONG TIEN KBNN — CAP NHAT 14/10: VAO = thu NSNN 1.565,4k ty (6T, so moi nhat cong bo) + TPCP huy dong 299,06k ty (9T, 60% KH) · RA (DTC) = 514,6k ty (8T, 45,9% KH) · Chenh lech VAO-RA van rat lon → luong tien dong tai KBNN cao, dao dong 460-743k ty trong nam", updated: "14/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] Bo TC + KBNN/HNX (TPCP 9T) + Nghi quyet 262 (DTC 8T)", note: "⚠️ LECH KY BAO CAO: thu NSNN moi co so 6T, DTC co so 8T, TPCP co so 9T — KHONG cong tru duoc chinh xac, cac con so tren chi de thay DO LON tuong doi · ⚠️ CHUA TIM DUOC thu NSNN 9T (da tim 14/10) · ⭐ AP LUC Q4: con ~54% KH DTC (hon 600k ty) phai giai ngan trong Q4 → neu giai ngan that thi day la nguon outside money lon nhat nam, nhung nha thau se phai VAY doi ung nen hieu ung rong len thanh khoan thap hon con so gross" },
