    giai_ngan_2t: { value: 652.1, updated: "18/10/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] Bo Tai chinh — bao cao nhanh qua TBTCVN 15/10", note: "GIAI NGAN DAU TU CONG luy ke den 8/10/2026: 652.125,4 ty dong = 63,8% ke hoach Thu tuong giao (1.022.607 ty) · Chuoi tien do: 51,2% → 52,9% (17/9) → 63,8% (8/10) — TANG TOC MANH 10,9dpt trong 3 tuan · ⭐ Y NGHIA CHO OUTSIDE MONEY: 652,1 nghin ty da bom ra nen kinh te, con ~370,5 nghin ty phai giai ngan trong gan 3 thang cuoi nam — ap luc don vao Q4 se la nguon tien lon chay qua he thong ngan hang, ho tro thanh khoan nhung cung la nguon ap luc CPI" },
    du_bao_q2:    { value: "⚠️ CHAM DIEM: DUNG DICH, SAI CO CHE — C/D ve 116,8% dung du bao 117-118% nhung KHONG phai nho DTC", updated: "01/11/2026", source: "[OFFICIAL] Bo Tai chinh qua Bao Chinh phu 27/10 (so den 22/10)", note: "⭐ CHAM DIEM DU BAO DAT 20/7 · NOI DUNG DU BAO: DTC con 645k ty (64,5% KH) phai giai ngan trong 6 thang; neu dat 80% (~516k ty) thi C/D tu 120,5% ve ~117-118% cuoi nam · KET QUA DICH: C/D Macro hien 116,8% — NAM TRONG range du bao, tham chi thap hon bien duoi · ⚠️ NHUNG CO CHE SAI: C/D giam KHONG phai do DTC bom tien tao tien gui, ma do NHNN CONG BO LAI MAU SO — so tien gui dan cu ky luc 17,77 trieu ty cuoi T8 lam mau so phinh ra. Day la hieu chinh thong ke, khong phai dong tien that · ⚠️ VE PHAN DTC THI DANG HUT TIEN DO: giai ngan tu 357k ty (6T) len 673,97k ty (22/10) = +316,97k ty, tuc moi dat 49,1% cua muc 645k ty trong 3,7/6 thang · De cham 516k ty con phai giai ngan 199k ty trong ~2,3 thang = 86,5k ty/thang, trong khi nhip thuc te gan nhat ~57k ty/thang (13.230,6 ty/tuan) — THIEU khoang 34% · ⭐ BAI HOC GHI LAI: du bao trung dich nhung sai duong. Neu khong tach bach thi lan sau se tin nham vao kenh DTC trong khi kenh that la hieu chinh mau so. Lan toi phai dat du bao RIENG cho tu so va mau so" },
    
